.TH PDRIVED 1 "October 2026" "PDrive for Linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pdrived \- daemon that mounts Proton Drive with FUSE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pdrived
.RI [ MOUNTPOINT ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pdrived
mounts
.I My files
of a Proton Drive account as a FUSE file system. Folders are listed on demand,
files are downloaded and decrypted when first opened and can be read while
downloading, and remote changes are applied from Drive events. Writes are
staged locally and uploaded when the file is closed; uploads interrupted by a
stop are resumed at the next start. It exposes its state, the quota and the
recent activity on the D-Bus session bus (name
.BR io.github.bpresles.PDrive ).
.PP
The daemon is normally started and supervised by
.BR pdrive-app (1).
Run it by hand for debugging, after
.BR "pdrive login" .
.PP
PDrive for Linux is an unofficial third-party client. It is not affiliated with,
or endorsed by, Proton AG.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I MOUNTPOINT
Where to make the drive appear. The default is the
.B mountpoint
setting. The real mount is in a hidden folder of
.IR ~/.local/share/pdrive ,
and
.I MOUNTPOINT
(by default
.IR ~/ProtonDrive )
is a symbolic link to it, so that the file manager shows a single entry.
.SH STOPPING
Stop with Ctrl+C or
.BR SIGTERM :
the drive is unmounted. If the mount is ejected (for example from the file
manager or with
.BR "fusermount3 \-u" ),
the daemon waits for a new mount request. FUSE mounting uses
.BR fusermount3 .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PDRIVE_VERBOSE
When set, log HTTP requests and SDK debug messages.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/pdrive/config.toml
Optional settings (under
.B $XDG_CONFIG_HOME
if set). Keys:
.BR mountpoint " (default " ~/ProtonDrive ),
.BR cache_size_gib " (default 10) and"
.BR show_window_at_startup " (default true, read by " pdrive-app ).
Unknown keys are rejected.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/pdrive/
Content cache and pending uploads.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/pdrive/
Hidden mount and list of files kept available offline (pinned.json).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pdrive (1),
.BR pdrive-app (1),
.BR fusermount3 (1)
.PP
https://github.com/bpresles/PDrive\-for\-Linux
